_id":"/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/architecture#贵阳网络摘要","content":"**边界与出口**：CCR1009（`192.168.99.1`，RouterOS 7.19.3）承担网关、DHCP、DNS、防火墙和策略路由；三路 PPPoE 为主出口，200M 静态专线（VLAN 214）为备用出口及公网入站。"},"61":{"id":"/guide/architecture-8","page_id":"/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/architecture#贵阳网络摘要","content":"**交换与无线**：CCR 与 H3C SW1 通过 `bond-sw1` 的四链路 LACP 互联；SW1 分别与 SW2、SW3 使用四链路 LACP Trunk；爱快 AP 接入 SW1 `GE1/0/43` Trunk。"},"62":{"id":"/guide/architecture-9","page_id":"/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/architecture#贵阳网络摘要","content":"**网段**：Office/RD 为 VLAN 10（`192.168.10.0/23`），IoT 为 VLAN 20（`192.168.20.0/23`），管理网为 VLAN 99（`192.168.99.0/24`）。"},"63":{"id":"/guide/architecture-10","page_id":"/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/architecture#贵阳网络摘要","content":"**策略出口**：Arch Linux 旁路由（`192.168.10.62`）通过 Hysteria TProxy 处理非 CN、`rhzy.ai` 与远端私网的 TCP/UDP 策略路由；公网 `:443` 入站 DNAT 到后端时，经旁路由保持对称回程。"},"64":{"id":"/guide/architecture-11","page_id":"/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/architecture#遵义互联","content":"遵义侧使用 CCR1072（RouterOS 7.23.2），承载本地 WireGuard 与 LAN/OVPN 网段。两地通过 GRE 连接，公网端点已脱敏，隧道地址为 `172.16.1.2` 与 `172.16.1.3`。"},"65":{"id":"/guide/architecture-12","page_id":"/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/architecture#运维约束","content":"VLAN 10、20、99 的端口成员、Trunk 的 tagged/native 设置和 LACP 对端必须与图表保持一致。"},"66":{"id":"/guide/architecture-13","page_id":"/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/architecture#运维约束","content":"每次变更路由标记、NAT、Hysteria 或 GRE 配置后，应验证远端私网与公网入站的对称回程。"},"67":{"id":"/guide/architecture-14","page_id":"/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/architecture#运维约束","content":"CCR、交换机、旁路由的配置备份与恢复步骤必须关联到变更记录，且不得提交密码、私钥或令牌。"},"68":{"id":"/guide/architecture-15","page_id":"/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/architecture#运维约束","content":"GRE 当前按明文记录；若后续承载敏感业务流量，应评估叠加加密隧道及密钥轮换方案。"},"69":{"id":"/guide/architecture-16","page_id":"/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/architecture#运维约束","content":"下一步可补充机柜端口映射、AP 覆盖图、各 VLAN 的访问控制矩阵和故障切换演练记录。"},"70":{"id":"/guide/decision-log","page_id":"/guide/decision-log","type":"page","content":"决策记录","breadcrumbs":["Docs","运行维护"],"tags":[],"url":"/guide/decision-log"},"71":{"id":"/guide/decision-log-0","page_id":"/guide/decision-log","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/decision-log","content":"以 ADR 形式保存影响范围、原因和复盘结论。"},"72":{"id":"/guide/decision-log-1","page_id":"/guide/decision-log","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/guide/decision-log#模板","content":"模板"},"73":{"id":"/guide/decision-log-2","page_id":"/guide/decision-log","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/decision-log","content":"每个会影响成本、体验、安全、施工或后续维护的选择，都应新增一份决策记录。文件名采用 `YYYY-MM-DD-主题.md`，例如 `2026-07-31-iot-vlan-isolation.md`。"},"74":{"id":"/guide/decision-log-3","page_id":"/guide/decision-log","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/decision-log#模板","content":"决策记录不追求长篇大论，关键是让半年后接手项目的人明白：当时为什么这样做、影响什么、由谁确认。"},"75":{"id":"/guide/getting-started","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","type":"page","content":"使用指南","breadcrumbs":["Docs","快速开始"],"tags":[],"url":"/guide/getting-started"},"76":{"id":"/guide/getting-started-0","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/getting-started","content":"了解智能办公室文档库的导航、搜索、阅读与维护方法。"},"77":{"id":"/guide/getting-started-1","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/guide/getting-started#先选择你的路径","content":"先选择你的路径"},"78":{"id":"/guide/getting-started-2","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/guide/getting-started#我只想查看项目","content":"我只想查看项目"},"79":{"id":"/guide/getting-started-3","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/guide/getting-started#我需要维护或推进项目","content":"我需要维护或推进项目"},"80":{"id":"/guide/getting-started-4","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/guide