ux）。"},"103":{"id":"/guide/getting-started-27","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/getting-started#搜索","content":"输入房间名称、设备类型、协议、场景或任务，例如“D会议室”、“窗帘”、“VLAN”或“验收”。"},"104":{"id":"/guide/getting-started-28","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/getting-started#搜索","content":"用方向键切换结果，按 Enter 打开，按 Esc 关闭。"},"105":{"id":"/guide/getting-started-29","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/getting-started#搜索","content":"搜索结果会直接定位到页面标题；打开后先确认所在页面和章节，再开始执行。"},"106":{"id":"/guide/getting-started-30","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/getting-started#信息应该放在哪里","content":"信息类型"},"107":{"id":"/guide/getting-started-31","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/getting-started#信息应该放在哪里","content":"存放位置"},"108":{"id":"/guide/getting-started-32","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/getting-started#信息应该放在哪里","content":"例子"},"109":{"id":"/guide/getting-started-33","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/getting-started#信息应该放在哪里","content":"范围、空间、现状、协作规则和技术决策"},"110":{"id":"/guide/getting-started-34","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/getting-started#信息应该放在哪里","content":"`content/docs/guide/`"},"111":{"id":"/guide/getting-started-35","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/getting-started#信息应该放在哪里","content":"项目总览、办公室布局、当前网络现状、决策记录"},"112":{"id":"/guide/getting-started-36","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/getting-started#信息应该放在哪里","content":"技术方案、实施要求和自动化规则"},"113":{"id":"/guide/getting-started-37","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/guide/getting-started#信息应该放在哪里","content":"`content/docs/implementation/`"},"114":{"id":"/guide/getting-started-38","page_id":"/guide/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","u