_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#初步设备规模","content":"建议按南北或东西划分故障域并预留容量"},"552":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-123","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#初步设备规模","content":"KNX/Modbus IP 网关"},"553":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-124","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#初步设备规模","content":"1～2 台"},"554":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-125","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#初步设备规模","content":"用于窗帘、空调、计量或配电箱执行器"},"555":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-126","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#初步设备规模","content":"Zigbee 协调器"},"556":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-127","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#初步设备规模","content":"1 台起"},"557":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-128","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#初步设备规模","content":"配合足够的有电路由设备；覆盖不足时再拆分网络"},"558":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-129","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#初步设备规模","content":"本地自动化主机 + UPS"},"559":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-130","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#初步设备规模","content":"1 套"},"560":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-131","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#初步设备规模","content":"配置备份、备用存储和恢复说明必须归档"},"561":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-132","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#初步设备规模","content":"以上是规划数量，不是采购清单。首轮采购应只覆盖试点区域，验证传感器覆盖、灯具驱动兼容性和窗帘电机噪声后再批量下单。"},"562":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-133","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"建议用 **D会议室 + A大厅1 + B办公室1 + C办公室1 + 两组不同朝向窗帘** 做最小闭环，覆盖会议、开放办公、独立办公室和东/西遮阳四种典型条件。"},"563":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-134","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"类别"},"564":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-135","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"试点配置"},"565":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-136","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"本地平台"},"566":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-137","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"1 台自动化主机、1 台 UPS、MQTT 与配置备份"},"567":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-138","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"照明"},"568":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-139","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"6～8 个可控回路或 DALI 逻辑组，包含开关与调光两种类型"},"569":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-140","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"传感器"},"570":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-141","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"6～8 个存在/照度点，2～3 个温湿度/CO₂点"},"571":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-142","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"窗帘"},"572":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-143","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"东、西朝向各 1 组电机、控制器和本地开/停/关面板"},"573":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-144","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"人机界面"},"574":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-145","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"4 个墙面场景面板，1 个管理仪表盘"},"575":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-146","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"网关"},"576":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-147","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"1 套照明网关、1 套窗帘/Modbus或KNX接口、1 个 Zigbee 协调器"},"577":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-148","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"试运行"},"578":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-149","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"先记录建议动作 3～5 天，再自动执行不少于 2 周"},"579":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-150","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#首轮试点范围","content":"试点通过后再采购其余区域设备；如果出现静坐误关灯、无线丢包、窗帘定位漂移或灯具调光频闪，应先调整技术路线而不是批量复制问题。"},"580":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-151","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制逻辑","content":"房间从“无人”变为“有人”时，只有实测照度低于该房间设定值才自动开灯。"},"581":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-152","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制逻辑","content":"靠窗灯组根据自然光单独调光，内侧灯组保持工作照度，避免全区同步开关。"},"582":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-153","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制逻辑","content":"离开后先进入低照度等待，再在延时结束后关闭；开放区、会议室和卫生间使用不同延时。"},"583":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-154","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制逻辑","content":"用户通过墙面开关手动操作后，该房间进入临时人工模式；直到人工超时、场景结束或确认无人后才恢复自动控制。"},"584":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-155","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制逻辑","content":"清扫、加班和活动场景必须显式启用，不能仅靠工作日时间表判断是否有人。"},"585":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-156","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#施工要求","content":"每个照明回路都必须能在控制平台离线时通过墙面开关控制。"},"586":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-157","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#施工要求","content":"大功率或多灯具回路由接触器/合适额定值的执行器驱动，不能使用小型无线模块直接承载全部负载。"},"587":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-158","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#施工要求","content":"调光灯具须确认驱动协议、最低亮度、频闪和断电恢复行为。"},"588":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-159","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#施工要求","content":"法定应急照明、疏散指示和消防联动保持独立。"},"589":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-160","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#分区原则","content":"一个房间不同朝向的窗户必须分组；同朝向连续窗可在电机容量允许时合并。"},"590":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-161","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#分区原则","content":"B 区东侧以早间遮阳为主，C 区西侧以午后防眩光和降温为主。"},"591":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-162","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#分区原则","content":"餐厅和前台以整体场景为主，独立办公室允许本地覆盖自动位置。"},"592":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-163","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#分区原则","content":"会议室进入演示场景时关闭窗帘，会议结束后恢复到进入场景前的位置。"},"593":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-164","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制与安全","content":"电机控制器必须实现“开/关互锁”，禁止正反转同时通电。"},"594":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-165","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制与安全","content":"优先选择具备位置反馈或行程反馈的电机；时间估算型电机应定期执行全开/全关校准。"},"595":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-166","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制与安全","content":"人员可触及的位置优先选用遇阻停止电机；强电供电与控制回路由具备相应资质的人员施工。"},"596":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-167","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制与安全","content":"墙面开、停、关按键直接接入控制器，本地操作优先于平台命令。"},"597":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-168","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制与安全","content":"自动遮阳后设置人工覆盖时间，避免用户刚打开窗帘又被规则立即关闭。"},"598":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-169","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制与安全","content":"窗帘供电、检修口和电机更换空间必须在吊顶施工前确认。"},"599":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-170","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#环境空调和能耗","content":"**空气质量**：会议室、开放区和餐厅根据 CO₂ 趋势联动新风或提醒开窗；阈值在试运行阶段根据人数和现场通风能力调校。"},"600":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-171","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#环境空调和能耗","content":"**空调**：人员存在只影响设定温度与运行模式，不直接频繁切断空调电源；短时离开保持，长时无人进入节能设定。"},"601":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-172","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#环境空调和能耗","content":"**机房**：温湿度、漏水、市电和 UPS 告警独立推送；自动化平台不得自动关闭核心设备。"},"602":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-173","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#环境空调和能耗","content":"**能耗**：至少分项计量照明、普通插座、空调/新风和机房；先建立基线，再调整下班和无人策略。"},"603":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-174","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#环境空调和能耗","content":"**餐饮区**：漏水、异常高温和燃气安全设备使用合规的独立报警器；平台只读取状态和通知，不取代本地声光报警或消防系统。"},"604":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-175","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"建议在现有 VLAN 10、20、99 基础上新增 **VLAN 30 Automation Services**："},"605":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-176","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"来源"},"606":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-177","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"目标"},"607":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-178","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"策略"},"608":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-179","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"VLAN 10 Office/RD"},"609":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-180","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"VLAN 30 Home Assistant"},"610":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-181","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"仅开放 HTTPS 和必要管理入口"},"611":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-182","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"VLAN 30 自动化服务"},"612":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-183","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"VLAN 20 IoT"},"613":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-184","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"允许到明确设备的 MQTT、Modbus TCP、HTTPS 等必要端口"},"614":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-185","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"VLAN 20 IoT"},"615":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-186","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"VLAN 10 / VLAN 99"},"616":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-187","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"默认拒绝"},"617":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-188","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"VLAN 20 IoT"},"618":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-189","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"互联网"},"619":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-190","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"默认拒绝，仅对 DNS、NTP 和经批准的固件更新临时放行"},"620":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-191","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"VLAN 99 Management"},"621":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-192","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"网关与控制器"},"622":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-193","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"仅管理员访问，记录配置变更"},"623":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-194","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"Home Assistant、MQTT、网关和协调器配置应定期备份；不得把设备密码、令牌、私钥或 KNX Secure 密钥提交到公开仓库。"},"624":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-195","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#实施阶段","content":"**现场勘查**：逐回路点灯，记录配电箱、灯具驱动、窗户尺寸、窗帘供电、空调接口和吊顶检修条件。"},"625":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-196","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#实施阶段","content":"**试点**：选择 D会议室、A大厅1、B办公室1、C办公室1和两组窗帘，运行不少于两周。"},"626":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-197","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#实施阶段","content":"**调整**：根据误关灯、传感器盲区、窗帘噪声、眩光和手动覆盖记录调整参数。"},"627":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-198","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#实施阶段","content":"**分区展开**：先公共区与开放区，再独立办公室，最后餐饮和能耗联动。"},"628":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-199","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#实施阶段","content":"**验收移交**：逐场景测试平台在线、平台离线、网络中断、断电恢复和手动覆盖。"},"629":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-200","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#方案冻结前必须确认","content":"每个灯光回路的负载、控制线和驱动协议。"},"630":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-201","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#方案冻结前必须确认","content":"每扇窗的朝向、宽度、轨道形式、电机供电和检修空间。"},"631":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-202","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#方案冻结前必须确认","content":"空调、新风和会议设备的品牌、型号与开放接口。"},"632":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-203","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#方案冻结前必须确认","content":"吊顶材质、传感器安装高度和遮挡条件。"},"633":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-204","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#方案冻结前必须确认","content":"哪些房间允许自动开灯，哪些只允许自动关灯。"},"634":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-205","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#方案冻结前必须确认","content":"工作时间、午休、加班、清扫和节假日规则。"},"635":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-206","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#方案冻结前必须确认","content":"消防、应急照明、门禁和监控的责任边界。"},"636":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-207","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#技术参考","content":"Home Assistant：本地控制优先的开源自动化平台"},"637":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-208","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#技术参考","content":"DALI Alliance：DALI-2 按钮、存在和照度传感器"},"638":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-209","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#技术参考","content":"Home Assistant Modbus 集成"},"639":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-210","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#技术参考","content":"Home Assistant KNX 集成"},"640":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-211","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#技术参考","content":"Zigbee2MQTT：开放的 Zigbee 到 MQTT 网桥"},"641":{"id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan-212","page_id":"/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/implementation/smart-office-plan#技术参考","content":"Home Assistant Matter 集成"},"642":{"id":"/management/acceptance","page_id":"/management/acceptance","type":"page","content":"施工与验收","breadcrumbs":["Docs","实施交付"],"tags":[],"url":"/management/acceptance"},"643":{"id":"/management/acceptance-0","page_id":"/management/acceptance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/management/acceptance","content":"用可复核的检查项把现场施工和最终交付闭环。"},"644":{"id":"/management/acceptance-1","page_id":"/management/acceptance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/management/acceptance#施工记录","content":"施工记录"},"645":{"id":"/management/acceptance-2","page_id":"/management/acceptance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/management/acceptance#交付验收清单","content":"交付验收清单"},"646":{"id":"/management/acceptance-3","page_id":"/management/acceptance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/management/acceptance#验收结论","content":"验收结论"},"647":{"id":"/management/acceptance-4","page_id":"/management/acceptance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/management/acceptance#施工记录","content":